Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:05:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: keep verified HLS fragments across intermittent
 refusals

The MissAV segment workers used to cancel the rest of an episode on one forbidden fragment. Continue reachable fragments, pace and bound same-rendition recovery, and require the complete ordered playlist before saving. Cover both clustered gaps and sustained refusals. Mihon image downloads and Animeko use different transfer paths.
